  "description": "Nationalism is the belief in the importance of one's nation and the promotion of national interests. The meme uses nationalist rhetoric to frame immigrants as threats to national identity and resources. This is a common political ideology that can be used to justify exclusionary policies and to promote xenophobia and racism.",
